    "INDEX-1<SEP>What is the best approach for learning a foreign language when you only have an hour a day to practice?<SEP>There are many approaches to learning a foreign language, but one effective method is to practice speaking and listening every day. You could try using language learning apps like Duolingo or Babbel, which have short exercises that can be completed in an hour. Additionally, you could try reading a foreign language book or watching foreign language movies or TV shows, which can help improve your listening and reading skills. Lastly, try to have conversations with native speakers, either in person or online, to practice speaking and listening. Consistency and exposure to the language are key factors in language learning, so try to practice regularly and make the most of the time you have available.": -4.15625,
